},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/keyboardshortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","title":"keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"keyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KeyEquivalent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI13KeyEquivalentV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"modifiers"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventModifiers","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14EventModifiersV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"localization"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KeyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV1